<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 21.28 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 21.28 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its linear government bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 21.28 billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p> OLOs offered *		 amount of new OLOs sold (in bln bfr)</p>
<p> code 285 5.00% (2001)	0.83</p>
<p> code 259 8.75% (2002)	2.00</p>
<p> code 273 6.50% (2005)	8.62</p>
<p> code 286 6.25% (2007)	9.83</p>
<p>NOTE - * in exchange for 18.95 bln bfr of OLO 266 6.75% (1997) and 2.33 bln bfr of OLO 254 9.25% (1997).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
